{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2023-12", "window": 2, "start_date": 1701993600, "end_date": 1702684799, "month_true_total": 148, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:04:23 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "153673755", "author": {"steamid": "76561198162746493", "personaname": "T.A.W.E.", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198162746493/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 31, "playtime_forever": 885, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 196, "last_played": 1706058002, "avatar": "d8979173240d1fd2b009b241ba02c13e14cfb946"}, "language": "english", "review": "very warhammer, good weapons fun mechanics, combat is fun also. love it!", "timestamp_created": 1702681117, "timestamp_updated": 1702681117, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153670756", "author": {"steamid": "76561199250238828", "personaname": "SgtGump9873", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199250238828/", "num_games_owned": 288, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 661, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 559, "last_played": 1725763450, "avatar": "729a9f2030448a9f377eb3e952c9ed5a4c8be0f7"}, "language": "english", "review": "The Emprah Approves", "timestamp_created": 1702677868, "timestamp_updated": 1702677868, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153666700", "author": {"steamid": "76561198157978357", "personaname": "MystikFruit", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198157978357/", "num_games_owned": 102, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 402, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 402, "last_played": 1679545782, "avatar": "704493025f0dc84296ca4d222f2e4e649a9fe983"}, "language": "english", "review": "Bought this on sale because $60 for this game in 2023 is EGREGIOUS, but it's a SOLID 3rd-person shooter. Really really fun to play. The execution mechanic is cool and unique for its time. The combos might feel a tad basic, but they're always fun to pull off and SUPER satisfying when used on groups of enemies. The gameplay just sucks you in and I never felt bored. \n\nHowever, the game is extremely short. It doesn't help that the multiplayer is practically dead so there's not much to do beyond the campaign, which would've been completely fine if I didn't beat it in around 6-7ish hours. I would've easily spent another 15 hours playing a longer campaign because the game is just so damn fun to play. Also, the bosses were just okay. They didn't typically stand out to me and as I'm writing this I can only really remember two. One of them being the final boss who left me thinking, \"Was that it?\" Still fun regardless, but I would've liked to have seen more from the bosses because I know this game could've totally had some badass ones. The story itself is passable. \n\nI also never had any problems running the game either. It ran perfectly, but of course, that'll vary between players and it seems it has.\n\nHyped for the 2nd game nevertheless", "timestamp_created": 1702673514, "timestamp_updated": 1702673514, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.517716526985168457", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153642502", "author": {"steamid": "76561198049200532", "personaname": "Luusormi", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/luusormi/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 309, "playtime_forever": 105, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 64, "last_played": 1764878519, "avatar": "fa1c7226bcb6b89e3485d4e0b2ad51026e0bc66b"}, "language": "english", "review": "A good game! Quite in line with actual 40k, which is a nice change!", "timestamp_created": 1702649675, "timestamp_updated": 1702649675, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "153638760", "author": {"steamid": "76561198367094816", "personaname": "DarkoDread", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198367094816/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 874, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 873, "last_played": 1717048433, "avatar": "18a83618826891dd83bdc2d6df899cddd72051be"}, "language": "english", "review": " yess", "timestamp_created": 1702645670, "timestamp_updated": 1702645670, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}